<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait '96 payment balance deficit rises - official.</title>
<headline>Kuwait '96 payment balance deficit rises - official.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The deficit in Kuwait's balance of payments soared to a provisional 21 million dinars ($69.3 million) in 1996 from a revised one million in 1995, central bank figures released on Sunday show.</p>
<p>But Kuwait injected 1.742 billion dinars in 1996 in the government's investment account compared with 42 million in 1995, provisional balance of payments figures showed.</p>
<p>Kuwait's overseas investment portfolio shrank to slightly more than $40 billion from over $100 billion due to the costs of the 1991 Gulf War and reconstruction following a seven-month Iraqi occupation, experts say.</p>
<p>(figures in billion dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996	    1995	    1994</p>
